# attnW8-GPTQ A0 campaign raw capture inputs (~90 GB): per-call tensor dumps,
# profiler traces, run logs, and event streams. The structured evidence
# distilled from them is retained (report.json, manifest.json, metadata.json,
# progress.json, receipt.json, and the seal0-revision reason notes); these raw
# inputs are not. Scoped to this campaign because attnw8-qualification,
# session-repair, and the step4/step5 data sets deliberately track their own
# .nsys-rep/.sqlite/.log evidence.
reports/attnw8-gptq/**/*.pt
reports/attnw8-gptq/**/*.nsys-rep
reports/attnw8-gptq/**/*.sqlite
reports/attnw8-gptq/**/*.log
reports/attnw8-gptq/**/*.jsonl
reports/attnw8-gptq/**/*.lock
reports/attnw8-gptq/**/seal0.json

# Root-cause evidence exception: the exact PCM two truncated responses emitted.
# The ASR verdict in reports/response-truncation rests on these seven clips, and
# the model trace they were cut from lives outside the repo under root-owned
# state that rotates. 2.1 MB total, one session, deliberately retained.
!reports/response-truncation/**/*.wav
